@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

# alice knows bob, bob knows alice: a genuine back-edge. Evaluating
# PersonShape(alice) -> PersonShape(bob) -> PersonShape(alice) revisits the
# pair (PersonShape, alice) while it is still on the path. Must produce the
# engine's ValidatorResult::Error, never unbounded recursion.
ex:alice a ex:Person .
ex:alice ex:knows ex:bob .
ex:bob ex:knows ex:alice .
